# Review candidate

Read-only. Do not repair or start another review.

## Specification
### P2.2 — Drive/documents combined canon and final validation

**Intent:** OPUS drive/documents canon/layout (R14), complete P2.2 + P2.3 implementation and final behavioral validation; further review cancelled by owner (D22).

**Why:** OPUS 13; AD03/04; owner requires completion and no further reviews (D22).

**Scope Included:** D21; all original P2.3 obligations in `artifacts/P2.2/combined-review-unit/P2.3-original.md`, without changing exclusions. Full OPUS Required Reads 0 minus ledger `note` transfers; D20 in full. R14 registrars/tests; unused types: src use→stop/escalate. Mechanical callers only, including three load files; core rollback fixture `version_no`. UPGRADE table, CHANGELOG [Unreleased], EN/RU docs/API golden. Preserve behavior, paths/names/JSON and P1.8 codes; docs/plan historical. D22 cancels only further independent review; all original non-review obligations remain mandatory.

**Scope Excluded:** All original P2.3 exclusions remain in force. OPUS/D20 future work: new Actions (P3.3/P3.7/P4.6), controller split (P6.1), DriveConfig (P2.5), recording traits (P5.1), command signatures (P7.2), other handle contract (P3.2/P3.3); other load changes.

