- `python3 plans/2026.09.29-№1-VAULTER-STABLE/artifacts/P2.2/combined-review-unit/acceptance.py documents-arch` → GREEN.

**Deliverables:** Original P2.3 deliverables in full;  Canon, registrars/tests, map/log, docs/golden.

